            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1177/1039856216689526</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText Label="OBJECTIVE" NlmCategory="OBJECTIVE">This article aims to provide a brief overview of the current evidence for psychotherapeutic approaches in older adults, together with clinical practice notes for interventions.</AbstractText>
                <AbstractText Label="CONCLUSION" NlmCategory="CONCLUSIONS">There are a range of appropriate psychotherapeutic options for the older adult that merit further study, and further opportunities for enhancing clinical practice.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
